  "limitations": [
    "IME tests use generated events; physical OS IME and other browsers remain unqualified. CDP compositionend was untrusted in these runs.",
    "Injected hidden timeout exercises recovery but does not explain or eliminate natural Worker timeouts.",
    "Browsers can suppress unload warnings; unsaved input is page-memory-only and lost on reload or termination. Crash and power-loss recovery are unqualified.",
    "No external node, public gateway, DNS, TLS, route cutover, QEMU app execution or legacy migration was qualified.",
    "CIDs are local and unpinned; the compiler PR was unmerged. Test harnesses are generated copies, not production code."
